 selected carpet-ground colors only on reviewed exterior floor pixels. The actual old green open-book is preserved rather than misidentified as floor. Every native furniture MID/OVER plane and opaque asset was separately checked for floor-color separation. Two actual static ship bookcases/cart now use the whole nativeCD16x26 blue case with complete wall/floor backing. Original table feet accidentally colored with the old carpet ramp retain every indexed pixel/shape while restoring the same blue hardware ramp already used immediately above them. All other functional furniture pixels remain identical. Source maps, collisions, events, actors, warps, puzzle scripts and all object positions remain unchanged. Lighthouse is excluded.",["game"]="gold",["id"]=11,["kind"]="third_party",["map"]="FAST_SHIP_B1F",["quadrant"]=0,["role"]="crystaldust_native_ship_planks_and_preserved_furniture",["sourceCells"]={{10,6},{24,6},{20,8},{22,8},{24,8}},["sourceCollision"]=0,["sourceFiles"]={["image"]="3ff5605ac40bd5e98b6d3c9a0a1dfc8150341eb00d2217644732bd53f3bcf70d",["maps"]="d2b8cc76190f4d8a1609cc86ed7d0697df45188533e09f905f7afa53f3e487ac",["metadata"]="6521a2c155b16cbb502c53810b25685290594687706afdfc1c6b845090eb232f"},["sourceHash"]="05788b34d88bd83442670172e18f849221df4a8e1c4b585afb680743699af586",["sourcePalettes"]={2,2,2,2},["sourcePriority"]={false,false,false,false},["sourceUrl"]="https://github.com/Sierraffinity/CrystalDust",["status"]="reviewed",["style"]="gen3",["tileset"]="TILESET_LIGHTHOUSE"},{["asset"]="assets/third_party/johto-hacks/crystaldust-ship-floor/composed-c7aaa2779309061a1d80cf2b.png",["assetFileHash"]="da05cc472d800eb135c86db1f8e659658c6a6434bcff44de088e11bbfa6ce749",["assetPixelHash"]="c7aaa2779309061a1d80cf2ba2fa763f4e9c03aa800daf4e9068f421cb6c9337",["compositionPixelHash"]="c7aaa2779309061a1d80cf2ba2fa763f4e9c03aa800daf4e9068f421cb6c9337",["credit"]="CrystalDust by Sierraffinity and contributors; complete native16px ship-plank floor MID561. Existing furniture p